  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【2026】全国の銘酒・地酒巡り旅！酒蔵見学＆利き酒・日本酒飲み比べができる極上温泉宿比較</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 via-emerald-50/40 to-stone-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-amber-950 flex items-center gap-2\">🍶 日本の名水と米が醸す「地酒」と郷土料理のマリアージュ</h3>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">南部杜氏の伝統息づく岩手、米どころ新潟の淡麗辛口、諏訪五蔵が並ぶ長野、富士山伏流水の山梨。夕食時に地元酒蔵の純米大吟醸や限定酒の利き酒セットを味わい、温泉に浸かる至福の大人の休日を過ごせます。</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🏆 日本酒好きに愛される厳選4大温泉宿</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第1位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">花巻温泉郷　新鉛温泉　結びの宿　愛隣館</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.27</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/9546/9546.jpg\" alt=\"花巻温泉郷　新鉛温泉　結びの宿　愛隣館 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 【岩手・花巻温泉郷】17の温泉湯巡り＆南部杜氏の地酒利き酒セットと白金豚会席</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">3つの豊富な自家源泉と渓流露天風呂。夕食時は「南部美人」「あさ開」「月の輪」など岩手を代表する地酒飲み比べセットと前沢牛・白金豚を堪能。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>ご夫婦、シニア、ファミリー、多彩な湯巡りと地酒を楽しみたい人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>17の浴槽湯巡りと岩手の銘酒利き酒なら迷わずここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D9546\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】花巻温泉郷　新鉛温泉　結びの宿　愛隣館 の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第2位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">越後湯沢温泉　湯沢グランドホテル＜新潟県＞</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.55</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/38764/38764.jpg\" alt=\"越後湯沢温泉　湯沢グランドホテル＜新潟県＞ 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 【新潟・越後湯沢】越後地酒飲み比べカウンターと魚沼コシヒカリ郷土料理</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">越後湯沢駅徒歩3分。館内に新潟の銘酒が揃うバーラウンジや庭園露天風呂を完備。「八海山」「久保田」「鶴齢」と炊きたて南魚沼コシヒカリの贅沢。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>新幹線観光客、カップル、新潟の酒と米を愛する人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>駅近好立地と新潟の銘酒・コシヒカリならここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D38764\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】越後湯沢温泉　湯沢グランドホテル＜新潟県＞ の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第3位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">信州上諏訪温泉　諏訪別邸　朱白（旧　双泉の宿　朱白）</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.43</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/52948/52948.jpg\" alt=\"信州上諏訪温泉　諏訪別邸　朱白（旧　双泉の宿　朱白） 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 【長野・上諏訪温泉】諏訪五蔵の銘酒飲み比べ＆諏訪湖一望の二色の自家源泉</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">諏訪湖畔に位置し、茶褐色と透明の2つの自家源泉を引湯。「真澄」「本金」「横笛」など諏訪五蔵の銘酒と信州牛会席が自慢。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>ご夫婦、記念日、湖の景色と地酒を味わいたい人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>諏訪湖パノラマ露天風呂と諏訪五蔵の地酒ならここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D52948\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】信州上諏訪温泉　諏訪別邸　朱白（旧　双泉の宿　朱白） の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第4位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">塩原温泉　やまの宿　下藤屋</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.59</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/5650/5650.jpg\" alt=\"塩原温泉　やまの宿　下藤屋 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 【山梨・石和温泉】名物甲州ワイン＆山梨地酒「七賢」「笹一」と甲州牛会席</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">老舗の風格漂う温泉旅館。美肌効果の高い温泉大浴場や、山梨の銘酒「七賢」や甲州ワインと味わう甲州牛ステーキが絶品。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>ご夫婦、一人旅、山梨の美酒美食を求める人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>石和温泉の名湯と山梨の美酒ならここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fhs%252FdQ4dX%252F%253Ff_no%253D5650\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】塩原温泉　やまの宿　下藤屋 の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-stone-50 via-sky-50/40 to-amber-50/40 border border-stone-200/90 rounded-3xl space-y-4 shadow-sm\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-stone-200 pb-2\">\n    💡 宿泊前にチェック！よくある質問＆お役立ちQ&A\n  </h3>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3.5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900 block mb-1\">💨 客室ドライヤー＆アメニティはある？</strong>\n      <p class=\"text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">客室または大浴場にドライヤーが完備されています。バスタオル・フェイスタオル・歯ブラシ・シャンプー・ボディソープ等の基本アメニティも揃っており、手ぶらでも快適に宿泊できます。</p>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"p-3.5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900 block mb-1\">🍙 素泊まり時の必要なもの＆朝食調達は？</strong>\n      <p class=\"text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">素泊まりプランでも客室に電気ケトルや冷蔵庫を完備。近隣のコンビニやベーカリー、道の駅でご当地グルメやお弁当を調達して持ち込み朝食を楽しむのもおすすめです。</p>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"p-3.5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900 block mb-1\">🚌 駅・空港からの送迎サービスはある？</strong>\n      <p class=\"text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">最寄り駅や主要バスターミナルからの無料送迎バス運行（事前予約制または定時運行）を行っている施設が多く、レンタカーなし・電車移動の旅でもスムーズにアクセス可能です。</p>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"p-3.5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900 block mb-1\">🍶 全国の地酒・名物グルメ・絶景スポットは？</strong>\n      <p class=\"text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">夕食時の地酒利き酒セットや旬の郷土料理、四季折々の絶景パノラマを満喫できます。シルバーウィークや連休は早期予約でお得なプランを確保するのがおすすめです。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
}